        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI Square Stainless Steel Double Cylinder Deadbolt </b>\r\n<p>\r\nStainless Steel Double Cylinder Deadbolt (keyed on both sides). These Grade 1 high security deadbolts fit standard pre-drilled doors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAll the exterior components, including the deadbolt, screws and strike plates are stainless steel. Both the outside and inside square housing plates are made from 1/2\" thick solid stainless steel.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of AHI 4860 Square Double Cylinder Deadbolt\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-1/2\" Square</li>\r\n<li>Outside Projection: 1/2\" </li>\r\n<li>Inside Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Marine Grade 316 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>ANSI Grade 1 Security</li>\r\n<li>Optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" Backset</li>\r\n<li>1\" Deadbolt with Hardened Steel Core</li>\r\n<li>Fit Standard 2-1/8\" Pre-Drilled Doors</li>\r\n<li>Schlage C keyway</lI>\r\n<li>Double Cylinder (keyed on both sides)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
